  "prefLabel": "Lot 1004.02 Surrendering a Ticket for Prize Payment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 1004.02 Surrendering a Ticket for Prize Payment. After an instant lottery game ticket has been provided to a clerk for payment and the prize payment has been provided to the player, the clerk shall retain and process the ticket in accordance with that lottery retailer’s policy.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 1000) #12747, eff 3-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot1000.html"
